WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:01.601
There is

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.369
new intelligence

00:00:02.369 --> 00:00:03.470
that's likely to rekindle

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:04.738
the unsettled debate

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:05.972
over the origins of COVID.

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:07.974
The US Department of Energy has concluded

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:09.943
that it most likely came from a lab leak

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:11.878
and not from an infected animal.

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:12.746
But to CNN.

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:13.980
Sources point out the department

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.582
only backs this new assessment

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:17.350
with, quote, low confidence.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:17.951
The Wall Street

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:19.486
Journal was first to report on this

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:19.953
and reporter

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.087
Michael Gordon was

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.222
part of the newspaper's team

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:23.356
that broke the story.

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.024
Michael,

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:25.725
thanks so much for being with us.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:26.493
What is

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.361
what is this new assessment based on?

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.029
Does it

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.663
add more clarity

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:32.632
or just to muddy the waters even more,

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.600
do you think?

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.836
Well, Jim, there's been a division

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:37.437
in the U.S.

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:40.006
intelligence community all along.

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:42.308
And previously,

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:45.545
as we reported, the FBI had asserted that

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:46.346
a lab leak

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:49.315
was likely with moderate confidence.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.351
And several other agencies

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:52.352
were on the other side

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.154
saying with low confidence

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:55.588
it might have emerged naturally,

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:57.057
meaning it left from an animal

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:58.258
to a human being.

00:00:58.258 --> 00:00:58.825
What's new

00:00:58.825 --> 00:00:59.392
here is

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.561
the Department of Energy has gone

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.530
from an IG Gnostic position,

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:05.632
saying they don't know where it came from

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:07.667
to leaning toward the lab theory.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.836
As we reported it, with low confidence.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.704
So now you have

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:12.739
two agencies

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:14.207
leaning toward the lab theory,

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:14.808
one with low

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:16.810
confidence, one with moderate confidence,

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.045
and four on the natural side

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:20.046
with low confidence.

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:21.581
There's still a division,

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:23.283
but it's significant

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:24.717
that the Energy Department,

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:26.352
which has national laboratories

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:27.921
under its jurisdiction,

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.622
is staking out this stance.

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:31.257
Well, let me ask you this.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:32.225
I want to play a clip

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:32.826
from White House

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:35.462
National Security Adviser Jake Sullivan

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:37.330
referencing your reporter

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.099
reporting on CNN earlier this morning.

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:41.835
Let's listen to what he had to say.

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:42.635
One of the things

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.671
in that Wall Street Journal report,

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:46.473
which I can't confirm or deny,

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:48.441
but I will say the reference

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:49.609
to the Department of Energy,

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:50.310
President Biden

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.278
specifically requested

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:53.580
that the national labs,

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:54.180
which are part

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.582
of the Department of Energy,

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:57.450
be brought into this assessment

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:01.554
because he wants to put every tool at use

00:02:01.855 --> 00:02:02.288
to be able

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:05.658
to figure out what happened here.

00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:06.426
Michael, I guess

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:07.927
one of the problems here is that

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:09.162
China has not exactly

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:12.098
been very cooperative in helping the U.S.

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:12.932
or the rest of the world,

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:13.433
for that matter,

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:14.634
get to the bottom of this

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.436
without that kind of cooperation.

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:17.670
Will we ever know

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.805
with any kind of certainty

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:20.240
where the virus came from?

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:23.042
Well, I certainly think

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.677
there's a potential to learn more.

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:26.179
And that's the view of

00:02:26.179 --> 00:02:27.780
certainly scientists like Dr.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.282
Relman at Stanford,

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:30.250
who have looked into that,

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.985
that they haven't exhausted

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:33.820
all the means of learning about it.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:34.654
But one thing, Jim,

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:36.055
that I think is important

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:37.824
is the American public really hasn't

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:39.692
been told enough about this.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:40.827
I mean, the administration

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:42.762
has done an intensive

00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:44.497
intelligence community review, a

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:45.765
90 day effort.

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:46.599
And what happened

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.434
was they updated it recently

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:51.204
and a several page long classified report

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:52.405
whose very existence

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:54.541
was not known until we wrote about it

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:56.109
in The Wall Street Journal.

00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:58.311
And the two parties that are

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.881
analyzing this as a potential lab leak,

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:04.350
the FBI and the Department of Energy.

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:07.187
They've not testified to the Congress

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:09.289
No one's heard directly from the FBI

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:10.590
or Lawrence Livermore

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.191
Laboratory,

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:12.559
which did an assessment on this,

00:03:12.559 --> 00:03:14.694
why they come to this conclusion.

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:15.762
And I understand

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:16.563
there's an

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:18.064
imperative to protect

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:20.133
classified information, but

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:21.301
it would seem possible

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:24.070
to describe the logic of this in somewhat

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.104
greater detail.

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:27.173
What we have now is a 17 page

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.810
unclassified report from October 20, 21

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.612
and not much direct

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:36.015
exchange

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:36.482
with the

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:37.083
different parts

00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:38.251
of the intelligence community

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:40.053
which are taking these different views.

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:41.254
I mean, on all sides.

00:03:41.254 --> 00:03:41.688
I mean,

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:43.423
it would think that the American public

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:44.057
could learn a lot

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:44.924
from hearing directly

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:46.993
from these organizations.

00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:48.361
Yeah.

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:50.263
I mean, I remember covering this

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:52.699
when this lab leak theory first developed

00:03:52.865 --> 00:03:54.067
during the Trump administration

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:55.568
And I spoke with a senior administration

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:56.402
official who said, no,

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:57.237
we have to

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.638
consider this as a possibility.

00:03:58.638 --> 00:04:00.106
And I remember Dr.

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.341
Anthony Fauci,

00:04:01.341 --> 00:04:03.243
who was really the leading scientist

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:03.943
during the Trump

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:06.813
and some of the Biden years on COVID,

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:07.747
saying, no,

00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:09.682
he really thought it was

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:11.618
a virus that came from a jump

00:04:11.618 --> 00:04:13.086
from animal to human.

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:14.087
And we just are

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:15.121
seemingly stuck in this

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:16.155
debate ever since.

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:17.590
Do you think that this

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.892
is going to change the debate?

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:20.760
Where do you see it headed?

00:04:22.028 --> 00:04:23.162
Well, first of all, Dr.

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:25.865
Fauci, now says and I heard him recently

00:04:26.866 --> 00:04:28.368
that he's open to both views,

00:04:28.368 --> 00:04:30.336
although he is certainly convinced

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:31.738
toward the natural view.

00:04:31.738 --> 00:04:32.639
But what's happened,

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:34.907
Jim, is that initially the theory was,

00:04:35.141 --> 00:04:37.277
well, it left from an animal host

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:38.745
to a human being. And that.

00:04:38.745 --> 00:04:39.579
Why was that?

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:40.146
Because that's

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:42.148
how it had happened before.

00:04:42.148 --> 00:04:44.717
But now we're three years into this.

00:04:44.717 --> 00:04:47.120
They've never found an animal, not one.

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:50.156
And there's been renewed attention

00:04:50.156 --> 00:04:51.758
on the kind of research activity

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:53.393
that was going on in Wuhan

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:54.727
and the safety conditions

00:04:54.727 --> 00:04:56.329
under which that activity

00:04:56.329 --> 00:04:58.831
was being carried out, which is not high.

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:01.434
And so the absence of an animal host,

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:03.169
no one has ever been found

00:05:03.169 --> 00:05:06.406
and a study of Chinese academic papers

00:05:06.406 --> 00:05:07.173
and more knowledge

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:09.142
about the kind of coronavirus research

00:05:09.142 --> 00:05:10.643
they were doing there with an eye toward

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:11.911
finding out a vaccine,

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:13.379
presumably

00:05:13.379 --> 00:05:15.481
has focused renewed attention on the lab.

00:05:15.815 --> 00:05:16.849
So what we have now

00:05:16.849 --> 00:05:18.685
is circumstantial evidence,

00:05:18.685 --> 00:05:20.153
but circumstantial evidence

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:21.621
that is tending

00:05:21.621 --> 00:05:24.290
to lean more in favor of the lab theory.

00:05:24.324 --> 00:05:25.124
What we don't have

00:05:25.124 --> 00:05:25.692
is anything

00:05:25.692 --> 00:05:27.894
like conclusive evidence of one

00:05:27.894 --> 00:05:28.861
or the other.

00:05:28.861 --> 00:05:31.497
And I don't think the jury's out on this.

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:32.565
I think that certainly

00:05:32.565 --> 00:05:33.232
the Congress

00:05:33.232 --> 00:05:35.268
is going to be digging into this

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:36.369
some more.

00:05:36.369 --> 00:05:38.604
But I think there's there's more light

00:05:38.604 --> 00:05:40.907
that can be brought to bear on this

00:05:40.907 --> 00:05:42.275
and possibly

00:05:42.275 --> 00:05:43.876
more information that the government

00:05:43.876 --> 00:05:45.945
has in terms of its analysis

00:05:45.945 --> 00:05:47.313
that can be declassified

00:05:47.313 --> 00:05:48.681
and made available

00:05:48.681 --> 00:05:50.049
to the American public.

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:50.817
There have been more than

00:05:50.817 --> 00:05:52.185
a million Americans

00:05:52.185 --> 00:05:54.420
Americans have died because of this.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.089
And we have a seven page

00:05:56.089 --> 00:05:58.358
declassified report from October 20.

00:05:58.358 --> 00:05:59.359
21.

00:05:59.359 --> 00:06:01.060
People are really interested

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:02.462
in learning more about it,

00:06:02.462 --> 00:06:04.364
even if the debate is going to continue.

00:06:05.732 --> 00:06:07.333
You're absolutely right about that.

00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:08.901
The American public has a right to know.

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:10.703
We need to get to the bottom of it.

00:06:10.703 --> 00:06:12.271
And your reporting has gotten us

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:12.939
in that direction.

00:06:12.939 --> 00:06:13.840
Michael Gordon

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:14.574
with The Wall Street

00:06:14.574 --> 00:06:15.675
Journal, thanks as always.

00:06:15.675 --> 00:06:16.943
We appreciate it.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.611
All right. Thank you.

00:06:18.611 --> 00:06:18.811
All right.

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:19.312
And with me now

00:06:19.312 --> 00:06:21.214
to talk about this further is former U.S.

00:06:21.214 --> 00:06:23.216
Ambassador to China Gary Locke.

00:06:23.216 --> 00:06:24.517
Ambassador.

00:06:24.851 --> 00:06:25.985
Thanks again for coming on.

00:06:25.985 --> 00:06:26.486
We appreciate.

00:06:26.486 --> 00:06:27.420
What is your reaction

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.155
to this latest report

00:06:29.155 --> 00:06:30.757
about the Energy Department

00:06:30.757 --> 00:06:33.126
now assessing Yes, with low confidence.

00:06:33.126 --> 00:06:35.828
They call it low confidence that COVID 19

00:06:36.362 --> 00:06:38.064
most likely came from a lab

00:06:38.064 --> 00:06:39.332
leak in China.

00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:40.800
Obviously, the debate isn't settled.

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:41.534
As we were just talking

00:06:41.534 --> 00:06:43.369
about with Michael Gordon.

00:06:43.369 --> 00:06:44.370
But this is interesting.

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:44.937
What do you think

00:06:47.206 --> 00:06:49.075
Well, thanks for having me on, Jim.

00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:50.309
It is very interesting.

00:06:50.309 --> 00:06:53.713
And as he indicated, we need to find out

00:06:54.046 --> 00:06:55.982
exactly how the coronavirus,

00:06:55.982 --> 00:06:57.784
the COVID virus

00:06:58.384 --> 00:06:59.118
hit the world

00:06:59.118 --> 00:06:59.685
and caused

00:06:59.685 --> 00:07:01.621
millions of deaths, not just in America,

00:07:01.621 --> 00:07:03.423
but all around the world.

00:07:03.423 --> 00:07:04.957
Our scientists really need to know

00:07:04.957 --> 00:07:05.958
because quite frankly,

00:07:05.958 --> 00:07:07.427
if it came from an animal,

00:07:07.427 --> 00:07:08.828
we need to be prepared.

00:07:08.828 --> 00:07:10.696
And we need to beef up our

00:07:10.696 --> 00:07:12.832
our public health response

00:07:14.534 --> 00:07:15.935
to the next pandemic.

00:07:15.935 --> 00:07:17.804
So it is important for our scientists

00:07:17.804 --> 00:07:20.072
to get to the bottom of this.

00:07:20.072 --> 00:07:22.241
And if the US ends up determining

00:07:22.241 --> 00:07:23.943
that this was a lab leak in China

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:25.378
and the Chinese government

00:07:25.378 --> 00:07:26.512
essentially covered it up

00:07:26.512 --> 00:07:27.146
and of course,

00:07:27.146 --> 00:07:27.747
as we were just

00:07:27.747 --> 00:07:30.283
discussing, we're not at that place yet.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:31.918
But who knows?

00:07:31.918 --> 00:07:32.618
The investigation

00:07:32.618 --> 00:07:34.020
may go in that direction.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.421
What should the consequences

00:07:35.421 --> 00:07:36.255
be for China

00:07:36.255 --> 00:07:38.558
and how do you apply those consequences

00:07:38.558 --> 00:07:39.859
when right now,

00:07:39.859 --> 00:07:40.760
as you know

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:41.861
from your background

00:07:41.861 --> 00:07:42.995
as an ambassador to China,

00:07:42.995 --> 00:07:44.630
things are not good

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:45.865
in terms of the relationship

00:07:45.865 --> 00:07:47.400
between the U.S. and China right now.

00:07:49.802 --> 00:07:50.269
Well, it's really

00:07:50.269 --> 00:07:51.504
important that the

00:07:51.504 --> 00:07:53.439
international health organizations,

00:07:53.439 --> 00:07:55.575
which includes the United States,

00:07:55.575 --> 00:07:58.044
work with China and all other countries

00:07:58.044 --> 00:08:00.513
to set up protocols on communication

00:08:01.614 --> 00:08:02.215
alerts.

00:08:02.215 --> 00:08:04.650
Any time an accident might occur

00:08:04.817 --> 00:08:05.551
or even if

00:08:05.551 --> 00:08:07.353
if it really did come from an animal,

00:08:07.353 --> 00:08:09.555
making sure that all that information

00:08:09.555 --> 00:08:11.090
is transmitted

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.258
to health organizations

00:08:12.258 --> 00:08:14.527
all across the world as soon as possible,

00:08:14.727 --> 00:08:16.295
so that political leaders,

00:08:16.295 --> 00:08:17.163
scientific leaders,

00:08:17.163 --> 00:08:18.965
medical leaders, health officials

00:08:18.965 --> 00:08:20.299
in each of the different countries

00:08:20.299 --> 00:08:21.367
can make a

00:08:21.367 --> 00:08:22.468
informed decision

00:08:22.468 --> 00:08:24.470
on how they're going to proceed.

00:08:24.871 --> 00:08:25.671
The part of the problem

00:08:25.671 --> 00:08:26.873
that we had with COVID,

00:08:26.873 --> 00:08:28.074
whether it came from a lab

00:08:28.074 --> 00:08:29.075
or came from animals,

00:08:29.075 --> 00:08:30.443
is that the Chinese

00:08:30.443 --> 00:08:31.010
were very,

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.880
very slow in alerting the world to it.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.682
It only came out from bits and pieces

00:08:36.682 --> 00:08:39.218
from scientists and doctors within China

00:08:39.352 --> 00:08:40.887
And by then it was too late.

00:08:40.887 --> 00:08:42.488
And so we really need to beef up

00:08:42.488 --> 00:08:44.891
our communication systems,

00:08:44.891 --> 00:08:46.526
our surveillance systems,

00:08:46.526 --> 00:08:49.195
so that all countries can act immediately

00:08:49.328 --> 00:08:49.996
And of course,

00:08:49.996 --> 00:08:51.464
we need to make sure that

00:08:51.464 --> 00:08:52.665
however this happened,

00:08:52.665 --> 00:08:54.800
we're prepared for the next pandemic,

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.435
whether it comes from another country,

00:08:56.435 --> 00:08:57.570
whether it comes from animals

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:58.437
or what have you.

00:08:58.437 --> 00:08:59.672
How are we going to be?

00:08:59.672 --> 00:09:01.274
How are we going to respond?

00:09:01.274 --> 00:09:03.209
Do we have vaccines available?

00:09:03.209 --> 00:09:05.444
Do we have protective gear available?

00:09:06.078 --> 00:09:09.282
Are our hospital systems up to,

00:09:09.448 --> 00:09:10.082
you know,

00:09:10.082 --> 00:09:12.118
have the capability to respond

00:09:12.118 --> 00:09:14.053
to a huge pandemic?

00:09:14.053 --> 00:09:14.687
Yeah, you're right.

00:09:14.687 --> 00:09:15.221
I mean,

00:09:15.254 --> 00:09:16.856
after all the terrible damage

00:09:16.856 --> 00:09:18.190
that COVID has done,

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:19.692
one would think

00:09:19.692 --> 00:09:20.393
that the world

00:09:20.393 --> 00:09:21.160
is going to be better

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.562
prepared for the next pandemic.

00:09:22.562 --> 00:09:23.462
I hope

00:09:23.462 --> 00:09:24.931
you're absolutely right about that.

00:09:24.931 --> 00:09:26.866
Let me let me shift to China's potential

00:09:26.866 --> 00:09:28.067
involvement in Ukraine.

00:09:29.068 --> 00:09:30.469
This is also a worrying development.

00:09:30.469 --> 00:09:30.903
This morning,

00:09:30.903 --> 00:09:32.004
the director of the CIA

00:09:32.004 --> 00:09:33.272
said he is confident

00:09:33.272 --> 00:09:35.041
that China is considering

00:09:35.041 --> 00:09:36.609
sending lethal aid to Russia.

00:09:36.609 --> 00:09:37.543
Let's listen to a bit of that.

00:09:37.543 --> 00:09:39.645
And I'll have your comment.

00:09:40.212 --> 00:09:41.514
Well, we're confident

00:09:41.514 --> 00:09:43.215
that the Chinese leadership

00:09:43.215 --> 00:09:45.017
is considering the provision

00:09:45.017 --> 00:09:46.352
of lethal equipment.

00:09:46.352 --> 00:09:47.820
We also don't see that

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.989
a final decision has been made yet,

00:09:49.989 --> 00:09:51.390
and we don't see evidence

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.759
of actual shipments of lethal equipment.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.429
And that's why I think Secretary Blinken

00:09:56.429 --> 00:09:58.531
and the president have cited important

00:09:58.531 --> 00:09:59.665
to make very clear

00:09:59.665 --> 00:10:01.801
what the consequences of that would be.

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:06.405
Ambassador, what is China up to here?

00:10:06.405 --> 00:10:07.573
Are they playing games?

00:10:07.573 --> 00:10:09.241
Is this something we should take serious?

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:10.977
What do you think

00:10:12.311 --> 00:10:13.846
Obviously, we need to take this

00:10:13.846 --> 00:10:15.147
information seriously.

00:10:15.147 --> 00:10:17.483
And and the president, the administration

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.952
has already conveyed

00:10:19.952 --> 00:10:21.120
to China

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.521
the severe implications

00:10:22.521 --> 00:10:24.390
were they to go forth

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.025
and make such a decision to provide

00:10:26.025 --> 00:10:26.792
lethal aid.

00:10:26.792 --> 00:10:28.194
But it's also important

00:10:28.194 --> 00:10:29.328
to share this information

00:10:29.328 --> 00:10:30.096
with world leaders

00:10:30.096 --> 00:10:31.330
and have other world leaders

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.165
who have very strong ties

00:10:33.165 --> 00:10:35.468
with China, whether it's India,

00:10:35.468 --> 00:10:38.070
other members of the European Union

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:39.605
and parts around the world,

00:10:39.605 --> 00:10:41.340
to also indicate

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.676
to China how unacceptable it would be

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:46.112
were it to provide lethal aid.

00:10:46.112 --> 00:10:48.014
This cannot be simply a response

00:10:48.014 --> 00:10:49.015
by the United States.

00:10:49.015 --> 00:10:51.651
There has to be maximum coordinated

00:10:51.651 --> 00:10:54.654
multilateral pressure on China.

